{"type":"standard","title":"Gabe Evans","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Gabe Evans</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q115458993","titles":{"canonical":"Gabe_Evans","normalized":"Gabe Evans","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Gabe Evans</span></span>"},"pageid":72348764,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Rep._Gabe_Evans_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Gabe_Evans_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/Rep._Gabe_Evans_official_photo%2C_119th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1000,"height":1250},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375488686","tid":"27dbf731-b309-11f1-b341-269d36d739b6","timestamp":"2026-09-18T02:32:13Z","description":"American politician (born 1986)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Gabe_Evans"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Gabe_Evans","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gabe_Evans?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Gabe_Evans"}},"extract":"Timothy Gabriel Joseph Evans is an American politician, former law enforcement officer, and former U.S. Army officer serving as the U.S. representative for Colorado's 8th congressional district since 2025. His district includes parts of Weld and Adams counties including the communities of Brighton, Lochbuie, Fort Lupton, Todd Creek, and Platteville. He is a member of the Republican Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>Timothy Gabriel Joseph Evans</b> is an American politician, former law enforcement officer, and former U.S. Army officer serving as the U.S. representative for Colorado's 8th congressional district since 2025. His district includes parts of Weld and Adams counties including the communities of Brighton, Lochbuie, Fort Lupton, Todd Creek, and Platteville. He is a member of the Republican Party.</p>"}